        [p('AMLO · 第615章《打擊洗錢及恐怖分子資金籌集條例》','AMLO · Cap.615 Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorist Financing Ordinance'),p('客戶盡職審查、備存紀錄、監管及調查、金融機構紀律處分、MSO發牌及覆核審裁處。','CDD, record-keeping, supervision and investigation, financial-institution discipline, MSO licensing and the Review Tribunal.'),p('明知違反第5條指明條文：最高100萬元及2年；意圖詐騙：100萬元及7年。無牌經營：100萬元及2年。','Knowing contravention of a section 5 specified provision: up to HK$1 million and two years; intent to defraud: HK$1 million and seven years. Unlicensed business: HK$1 million and two years.')],
        [p('DTROP · 第405章《販毒（追討得益）條例》','DTROP · Cap.405 Drug Trafficking (Recovery of Proceeds) Ordinance'),p('販毒得益：處理犯罪得益罪、披露、調查、限制及沒收。','Drug-trafficking proceeds: the dealing offence, disclosure, investigation, restraint and confiscation.'),p('洗錢罪最高500萬元及14年；不披露知悉／懷疑：5萬元及3個月；通風報訊：3年。','Laundering: up to HK$5 million and 14 years; failure to disclose: HK$50,000 and three months; tipping off: three years.')],
