        [p('UNATMO · 第575章《聯合國（反恐怖主義措施）條例》','UNATMO · Cap.575 United Nations (Anti-Terrorism Measures) Ordinance'),p('恐怖分子財產、第8A條處理財產、第11L條資助跨國旅行、披露；實施安理會第1373號決議。','Terrorist property, section 8A dealing, section 11L financing of inter-state travel, disclosure; implements UNSCR 1373.'),p('相關TF罪行可監禁14年及罰款。保安局局長凍結財產及發牌准許例外；行政長官在憲報刊登指定。','Relevant TF offences carry up to 14 years and a fine. The Secretary for Security freezes property and licenses exceptions; the Chief Executive gazettes designations.')],
