        [p('覆核審裁處','Review Tribunal'),p('覆核指明決定：確認、更改、撤銷並代以另一決定，或發還；主席加兩名成員，成員由財經事務及庫務局局長委任。','Reviews specified decisions: confirms, varies, sets aside and substitutes, or remits; a chairman and two members appointed by the Secretary for Financial Services and the Treasury.'),p('申請覆核本身不暫緩決定；上訴須上訴法庭許可。','Applying for review does not itself stay the decision; appeal needs the Court of Appeal’s leave.')],
